<title>USA: U.S. hog and cattle slaughter estimates - trade.</title>
<headline>U.S. hog and cattle slaughter estimates - trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Livestock analysts estimated Monday's hog slaughter from 330,000 to 348,000 head versus 330,000 a week ago and 327,000 a year ago.</p>
<p>Cattle slaughter estimates ranged from 96,000 to 119,000 head versus 87,000 a week ago and 128,000 a year ago.</p>
<p>--Jerry Bieszk 312-408-8725</p>
</text>
